  <MAP_Settings.AnnihilationCannonCrater.Label>湮灭炮留下深坑</MAP_Settings.AnnihilationCannonCrater.Label>
  <MAP_Settings.AnnihilationCannonCrater.Description>开启后，湮灭炮将在命中地点生成一个深坑。同时对我方太阳和敌方太阳生效。</MAP_Settings.AnnihilationCannonCrater.Description>
  <MAP_Settings.Group.SkillsAndOffspring>技能与繁育</MAP_Settings.Group.SkillsAndOffspring>

  <!-- 模块：工作标签页 -->
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.WorkTab.Label>将机械族机械师显示在工作标签页</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.WorkTab.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.WorkTab.Description>启用后，符合条件的机械族机械师会被追加显示到原版“工作”标签页中，方便调整工作优先级。若与修改工作标签页或工作优先级界面的 MOD 冲突，请关闭此项。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.WorkTab.Description>

  <!-- 模块：头像显示 -->
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.PortraitDisplayForAllSaves.Label>在所有存档中启用机械族"头像显示"</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.PortraitDisplayForAllSaves.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.PortraitDisplayForAllSaves.Description>启用后，在所有存档中显示机械族中的"头像显示"开关。关闭时此功能仅在机械族机械师剧本中启用。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.PortraitDisplayForAllSaves.Description>

  <!-- 模块：数据处理 -->
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.DataProcessing.ImmediateDraftRefresh.Label>切换征召状态时立即刷新动态分配</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.DataProcessing.ImmediateDraftRefresh.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.DataProcessing.ImmediateDraftRefresh.Description>开启后，受动态分配管理的机械族在切换征召状态时立刻执行一次动态分配的状态检测。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.DataProcessing.ImmediateDraftRefresh.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.LoadDeathDiagnostics.Label>启用加载期死亡诊断日志</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.LoadDeathDiagnostics.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.LoadDeathDiagnostics.Description>这是一项开发者功能。如果你的机械族机械师在存档加载期间意外死亡，可以使用该功能生成日志并发送给作者检查。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.LoadDeathDiagnostics.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.PreventLoadDeath.Label>阻止机械族机械师在存档加载时死亡</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.PreventLoadDeath.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.PreventLoadDeath.Description>开启后，阻止加载存档期间原本存活的机械族机械师因奇妙の逻辑冲突意外死亡。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.PreventLoadDeath.Description>

  <!-- 模块：兼容层日志 -->
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.Compatibility.DetailedLogging.Label>启用兼容层详细日志输出</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.Compatibility.DetailedLogging.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.Compatibility.DetailedLogging.Description>开启后在兼容补丁加载失败时输出详细日志</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.Compatibility.DetailedLogging.Description>

  <!-- 模块：植入体功能 -->
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.BrainImplants.Label>允许机械族机械师安装脑部植入体</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.BrainImplants.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.BrainImplants.Description>开启后，机械族机械师可以被右键下达安装脑部植入体的命令。此功能会略微影响游戏启动时的加载速度。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.BrainImplants.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.BrainImplants.RestartRequired>此设置将在重新启动游戏后生效。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.BrainImplants.RestartRequired>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MoonImplants.Label>允许「月亮」安装仿生体</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MoonImplants.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MoonImplants.Description>启用后，「月亮」可以通过右键植入体安装。此功能会略微影响游戏启动时的加载速度。修改此设置后需要重新启动游戏。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MoonImplants.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MoonImplants.RestartRequired>该设置已更改，需要重新启动游戏后才能生效。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MoonImplants.RestartRequired>

  <!-- 模块：仿生子嗣 -->
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.SyntheticOffspring.InheritXenogenes.Label>通过仿生孕育的子嗣继承异种基因</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.SyntheticOffspring.InheritXenogenes.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.SyntheticOffspring.InheritXenogenes.Description>开启后，具备仿生孕育能力的机械体孕育的子嗣将额外继承配偶的异种基因。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.SyntheticOffspring.InheritXenogenes.Description>

  <!-- 模块：肃清指令界面 -->
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.PurgeDirective.UiLoadingScreen.Label>启用肃清指令UI加载界面</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.PurgeDirective.UiLoadingScreen.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.PurgeDirective.UiLoadingScreen.Description>开启时，显示联络主脑时的进度条界面。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.PurgeDirective.UiLoadingScreen.Description>

  <!-- 模块：技能兴趣下限 -->
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MinimumSkillPassion.Label>机械族机械师技能兴趣度最低为好奇</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MinimumSkillPassion.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MinimumSkillPassion.Description>开启后，所有机械族机械师的技能兴趣度不会低于好奇。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.MinimumSkillPassion.Description>

  <!-- 模块：共生盟约 -->
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.SymbiosisCovenant.Section>共生盟约</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.SymbiosisCovenant.Section>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.SymbiosisCovenant.GrowthMultiplier.Label>共生盟约成长倍率：×{0}</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.SymbiosisCovenant.GrowthMultiplier.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.SymbiosisCovenant.GrowthMultiplier.Description>调整共生盟约中信任度与团结度的正负变化倍率。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.SymbiosisCovenant.GrowthMultiplier.Description>

  <!-- 模块：战略节点概率 -->
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.Section>战略节点概率</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.Section>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.Description>注意：设置的是每座符合条件的完整节点的独立基础概率；多个节点的最终概率使用公式 1-(1-p)^n 计算。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.FactionOutpost>普通派系前哨</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.FactionOutpost>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.FactionOutpost.RaidChance.Label>单个敌对前哨每日袭击概率：{0}%</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.FactionOutpost.RaidChance.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.FactionOutpost.RaidChance.Description>每座符合条件的完整敌对派系前哨，每日进行额外袭击检查时使用的独立基础概率。0%表示禁用由普通派系前哨额外产生的袭击；100%表示只要至少存在一座符合条件的完整敌对前哨，该次检查就必定通过概率判定。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.FactionOutpost.RaidChance.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.FactionOutpost.SupportChance.Label>单个盟友前哨支援概率：{0}%</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.FactionOutpost.SupportChance.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.FactionOutpost.SupportChance.Description>每座符合条件的完整盟友派系前哨，在殖民地遭遇敌对袭击后提供援军的独立基础概率。原有共同敌人和派系敌对关系判定保持不变。0%表示不提供这种自动援军。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.FactionOutpost.SupportChance.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.FactionOutpost.GarrisonThreatScale.Label>普通派系前哨防卫强度：{0}%</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.FactionOutpost.GarrisonThreatScale.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.FactionOutpost.GarrisonThreatScale.Description>仅影响之后新生成的普通派系前哨。前哨始终在创建时根据附近玩家殖民地的当前原版威胁点数，乘以此倍率保存守军预算，并按完成态预算固定四档建筑布局之一。进入地图时按保存的预算与布局生成守军和建筑；财富变化或调整本设置均不会改变已有前哨的预算与布局档位。联合军事行动以此类前哨为目标时，也会使用该前哨保存的防卫预算计算援军规模。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.FactionOutpost.GarrisonThreatScale.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.MechHiveNode>机械巢节点</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.MechHiveNode>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.MechHiveNode.RaidChance.Label>单个敌对节点每日袭击概率：{0}%</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.MechHiveNode.RaidChance.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.MechHiveNode.RaidChance.Description>与机械巢敌对时每个机械巢节点每日进行额外袭击的概率。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.MechHiveNode.RaidChance.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.MechHiveNode.SupportChance.Label>单个盟友节点支援概率：{0}%</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.MechHiveNode.SupportChance.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.MechHiveNode.SupportChance.Description>与机械巢为盟友时每个机械巢节点提供援军的概率。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.StrategicNodes.MechHiveNode.SupportChance.Description>

  <!-- 模块：正义能力 -->
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeAbilities.Section>正义能力</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeAbilities.Section>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeAbilities.RestrictBossHackTargets.Label>限制机体骇入 BOSS 目标</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeAbilities.RestrictBossHackTargets.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeAbilities.RestrictBossHackTargets.Description>默认开启。开启后，机体骇入无法以除炼狱魔王、战争女皇之外的机械族 BOSS 为目标。关闭后恢复原有目标规则。「正义」- 重装指挥单元始终无法被机体骇入。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeAbilities.RestrictBossHackTargets.Description>

  <!-- 模块：正义 BOSS 难度 -->
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.Section>正义 BOSS 战难度</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.Section>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.Description>调整「正义」- 重装指挥单元的BOSS战难度。设施部署和新波次开始时读取当前设置，已开始的空投及重试沿用该次参数。总波数实时生效，但不会打断未完成波次，也不会撤销已经确定的撤退。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.DiagnosticLogging.Label>启用正义 BOSS 详细诊断日志</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.DiagnosticLogging.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.DiagnosticLogging.Description>开发者功能，开启后「正义」BOSS战将生成详细的日志。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.DiagnosticLogging.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.MortarShield.Label>召唤高角护盾</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.MortarShield.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.MortarShield.Description>启用后，「正义」部署设施时会召唤一个高角护盾。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.MortarShield.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.BulletShield.Label>召唤低角护盾</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.BulletShield.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.BulletShield.Description>启用后，「正义」部署设施时会召唤一个低角护盾。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.BulletShield.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AutoMortar.Label>自动迫击炮数量：{0}</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AutoMortar.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AutoMortar.Description>「正义」到达后部署的自动迫击炮数量。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AutoMortar.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AutoChargeBlaster.Label>自动电荷冲击炮塔数量：{0}</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AutoChargeBlaster.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AutoChargeBlaster.Description>「正义」到达后部署的自动电荷冲击炮塔数量。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AutoChargeBlaster.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AutoInferno.Label>自动地狱火加农数量：{0}</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AutoInferno.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AutoInferno.Description>「正义」到达后部署的自动地狱火加农炮塔数量。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AutoInferno.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.TotalWaves.Label>召唤波数：{0}</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.TotalWaves.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.TotalWaves.Description>「正义」完成该数量的机械族召唤波次后，将停止继续召唤，并在一段时间撤离。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.TotalWaves.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.WaveInterval.Label>波次间隔：{0} 秒</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.WaveInterval.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.WaveInterval.Description>正义召唤两个机械族波次之间的等待时间。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.WaveInterval.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.MechsPerWave.Label>每波机械族数量：{0}</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.MechsPerWave.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.MechsPerWave.Description>「正义」每波召唤的机械族数量。注意：第一波会召唤该数值两倍的机械族。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.MechsPerWave.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AllowBossReplacement.Label>允许生成 BOSS 机械族</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AllowBossReplacement.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AllowBossReplacement.Description>启用后，每个正常波次有2%概率生成一个BOSS机械族。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.AllowBossReplacement.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.ApplyMobileCombat.Label>为召唤单位添加机动作战</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.ApplyMobileCombat.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.ApplyMobileCombat.Description>开启后，「正义」会为其召唤的机械族添加机动作战健康状态。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.JusticeBoss.ApplyMobileCombat.Description>

  <!-- 模块：机械主脑 BOSS 战难度 -->
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.Section>机械主脑 BOSS 战难度</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.Section>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.Description>调整机械主脑战斗时的额外战斗技能参数。战斗中修改会影响后续技能启动及冷却排程，当前动作沿用已锁定的参数，已排定的冷却不会重新计时。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.EnableExtraSkills.Label>启用机械主脑额外 BOSS 技能（总开关）</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.EnableExtraSkills.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.EnableExtraSkills.Description>开启后，允许主脑使用额外技能。战斗中关闭会暂停新技能及尚未成功生成单位的召唤重试；已开始的 EMP、带宽干扰和已发出的空投继续处理。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.EnableExtraSkills.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.Summoning.Subsection>召唤机械族</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.Summoning.Subsection>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.EnableSummoning.Label>启用召唤机械族</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.EnableSummoning.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.EnableSummoning.Description>开启后，主脑召唤额外的机械族援军。关闭会暂停新批次及尚未成功生成单位的重试，重新开启后继续原批次；已发出的空投照常落地。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.EnableSummoning.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.SummonInterval.Label>召唤间隔：{0} 秒</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.SummonInterval.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.SummonInterval.Description>主脑两次正常召唤波次之间的等待时间。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.SummonInterval.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.MechsPerWave.Label>每波机械族数量：{0}</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.MechsPerWave.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.MechsPerWave.Description>每次正常召唤波次尝试召唤的机械族数量。实际生成数量受最大同时存活数量限制（空投途中单位也计入上限）。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Settings.CerebrexBoss.MechsPerWave.Description>
